v1\",\"sha256\":\"ba18237c16ba9bed43b058c27b135a7bb2f19fd8d79ee0ac76b309df26ba3ee7\"}}","parentIdentity":"urn:stdo:3.0.2:composition-release:interpretation:1","parentRawSha256":"fc3114dd666218c387a64846b755a14979182f488de64ffff6a6d305a9698793","records":[{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:6cc92570e9e1d4cc0b93ea894305e162","key":7,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:6cc92570e9e1d4cc0b93ea894305e162\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[\"Within the release-profile scope and explicit qualifications in this source section.\"],\"definition\":\"An explicitly selected stable-v1 annotated strict semantic-version tag is immutable and distinct from a legacy RC selector; its fresh-line, marker, manifest and successor conditions are binding.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":244,\"path\":\"standards/RELEASE.md\",\"quote\":\"### Stable cuts\\n\\nThe `stable-v1` profile publishes an immutable release directly as\\n`refs/tags/<project>/v<major>.<minor>.<patch>`. Each numeric component is a\\nnonnegative decimal integer, with no leading zero except the single digit\\n`0`. The tag is annotated, targets a commit and contains exactly one\\nstandalone annotation line (P3):\\n\\n```text\\nSTDO-Release-Profile: stable-v1\\n```\\n\\nIts exact release declaration names the same stable cut, declared payload,\\nsource selection and predecessor. The installed manifest records\\n`release.profile = \\\"stable-v1\\\"` alongside the complete identity of\\n[Project-subtree release identity](#project-subtree-release-identity).\\nAn RC manifest retains its prior shape; adding stable support must not\\nchange the canonical bytes of a historical release manifest (P3, P4b).\\n\\nThe stable coordinate is available only on a fresh version line with no\\nsame-version RC tag in either the historical or project-qualified namespace\\nand no historical unqualified bare-version tag. The stable tag itself is\\ncreate-only. A same-line collision or a missing, duplicated or different\\nprofile marker refuses stable acquisition; bare spelling or annotation alone\\ncannot turn an RC selector into an immutable cut (P3, P5).\\n\\nThere is no separate version-line selector or RC branch for this profile.\\nA channel `stdo://channels/<major>.<minor>.<patch>` may discover that exact\\nimmutable stable tag; its cut ordinal is absent (`null`), and resolution\\nmust verify the stable profile and complete identity. That channel route\\ncreates neither another tag nor mutable alias semantics. Consumer adoption\\nstill follows §4 (P3, P6).\\n\\nA published stable tag never moves. Any change to its qualifying bytes\\nrequires a new version and a new immutable cut, not an RC added to the\\nalready stable line. Historical RC lines keep their selector semantics,\\nrefs, objects, peels and URIs; this profile neither finalises nor renames\\nthem. An RC-labelled published release remains a proper release (P3, P4b).\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/RELEASE.md#stable-cuts\",\"start_line\":206}],\"label\":\"Stable immutable cut\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generat