mits.\\n\\nAdequacy retains the distinctions required for the task's decisions and\\ncontinuations, including unresolved obligations, result standing, currentness and\\nauthority. If the permitted material is insufficient, acquire an authorized\\nextension, narrow the task with the owner, use a suitable actor or return the\\nunresolved outcome. Permission is not evidence of sufficiency, and a budget is\\nnot permission to omit a deciding condition. This applies [FOUNDATIONS Observation sufficiency](FOUNDATIONS.md#assurance-relations)\\nand its scoped preservation law; it supplies no general optimal context selector (P1, P2, P6).\",\"uncertainty\":\"\"},\"refusal\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"]}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:5fdd0f032bfa90d14b79b83f7cf86a85","key":19,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:759dcede800bb40bf1b35ef8393b00f2\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:5fdd0f032bfa90d14b79b83f7cf86a85\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[\"Apply the clause within its explicitly 