authorized successor relation and affected reassessment. The [ACTIVATION refinement contract](ACTIVATION.md#refinement) governs this\\npreservation. Matching signatures, labels or a sample output is insufficient (P4a, P6). New capabilities may be\\nadded without silently widening existing consumers' duties or grants.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-06--readiness-cycles-and-replacement\",\"start_line\":964}],\"label\":\"Readiness cycles and lawful replacement\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:47baa21d65a4c2545e5bcfe1d5034327","key":18,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:fd620dc380b563ff699c644f38d970b4\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:47baa21d65a4c2545e5bcfe1d5034327\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:constraint-kind:authored-source-statement\",\"latitude_ref\":[],\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author\",\"predicate\":{\"conditions\":[\"Apply the clause within its explicitly stated scope and qualifications.\"],\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":979,\"path\":\"standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md\",\"quote\":\"### PC-06 — Readiness, cycles and replacement\\n\\nWork selects a dependency-ready frontier at the required subjects and revisions.\\nA cycle in declared Product relationships need not be 