RC publication.\\nIt instead creates one stable-v1 annotated tag and any explicitly selected\\nrelease branch, with no RC branch or separate selector. Before publication,\\nverify the fresh-line conditions of [Stable cuts](#stable-cuts), bind remote\\nabsence for the immutable tag and bind every mutable destination's expected\\nobject. Publish the selected refs atomically where supported; a changed\\nexpectation stops publication for reconciliation. Read back the remote tag\\nobject, commit, subtree and declared assets. The release is publicly classified\\nas a normal published release; release-host flags do not replace exact identity\\nor qualification evidence (P3, P5, P6).\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/RELEASE.md#immutable-stable-publication\",\"start_line\":361}],\"statement\":\"A stable naming and discovery profile alone does not establish stronger semantic qualification.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"]"}],"external":[{"identity":"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-03--the-edges-contract-and-authority-record","payload":"{\"basis_relation\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis-relation:exact\",\"evidence_identity\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:evidence:explicit-generation-signature\",\"external_identity\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-03--the-edges-contract-and-authority-record\",\"external_target_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:external-kind:source-section\",\"reference_domain\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:reference-domain:declared\",\"resolution_basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"resolved_target_identity\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-03--the-edges-contract-and-authority-record\"}"},{"identity":"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-05--context-construction-and-clean-room-conditions","payload":"{\"basis_relation\":\"urn:a-c: