\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"min_items\":1,\"type\":\"array\"},\"label\":{\"min_length\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"stop_kinds\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:stop:no-execution-or-acceptance\"]},\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:signature:compact-source-proposal-v1\",\"sha256\":\"ba18237c16ba9bed43b058c27b135a7bb2f19fd8d79ee0ac76b309df26ba3ee7\"}}","parentIdentity":"urn:stdo:3.0.2:composition-release:interpretation:1","parentRawSha256":"fc3114dd666218c387a64846b755a14979182f488de64ffff6a6d305a9698793","records":[{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal","family":"objects","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:fd620dc380b563ff699c644f38d970b4","key":5,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:fd620dc380b563ff699c644f38d970b4\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author\",\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"],\"sort\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:sort:authored-concept\",\"value\":{\"conditions\":[\"The selected engagement has the Product-composition scope described by this clause.\"],\"definition\":\"Dependency-ready work needs executable prerequisites; provider replacement preserves material contracts or enters an authorized successor relation.\",\"exceptions\":[],\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":979,\"path\":\"standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md\",\"quote\":\"### PC-06 — Readiness, cycles and replacement\\n\\nWork selects a dependency-ready frontier at the required subjects and revisions.\\nA cycle in declared Product relationships need not be a cycle in the selected\\nwork. A cycle of current prerequisite claims requires an executable resolution:\\nfor example an admitted prior revision, explicit seed, staged contract or bounded\\niteration with its continuation/stop conditions. Naming a lead alone does not\\nsupply a missing prerequisite or establish convergence.\\n\\nReplacing a constituent or refining it into further Products preserves the\\nconsumer's material contract: meaning, preconditions, effects, failures,\\nauthority, lifecycle, evidence and subsequent obligations. A semantic change\\nrequires an authorized successor relation and affected reassessment. The [ACTIVATION refinement contract](ACTIVATION.md#refinement) governs this\\npreservation. Matching signatures, labels or a sample output is insufficient (P4a, P6). New capabilities may be\\nadded without silently widening existing consumers' duties or grants.\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-06--readiness-cycles-and-replacement\",\"start_line\":964}],\"label\":\"Readiness cycles and lawful replacement\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal","family":"constraints","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:47baa21d65a4c2545e5bcfe1d5034327","key":18,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"applies_to\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:fd620dc380b563ff699c644f38d970b4\"],\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:47baa21d65a4c2545e5bcfe1d5034327\",\"judgment_kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:judgment-kind:external-semantic-review\",\"kind\":\"ur