eliance\",\"start_line\":980}],\"statement\":\"Material impact may remain unknown after a change.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"]"}],"seeds":[27],"unresolved":[{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal","family":"residuals","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:9f379db2ef9a8451a57bc145d36d9db3","key":29,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"consequence\":\"Keep unsupported adequacy/clean-room claims unresolved and use the declared re-entry.\",\"context\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal\",\"id\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:9f379db2ef9a8451a57bc145d36d9db3\",\"invalidation\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:invalidation:source-or-interpretation-change\",\"kind\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:residual-kind:authored-uncertainty\",\"owner\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author\",\"re_entry\":[],\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"],\"subject\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:acc8c965a48d0a6498144ae726e9a1a5\",\"uncertainty\":{\"grounding\":[{\"end_line\":963,\"path\":\"standards/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md\",\"quote\":\"### PC-05 — Context construction and clean-room conditions\\n\\nAn actor's selected context must satisfy both permission and adequacy for its\\nengagement. Permission covers the source information and permitted derivations,\\nnot only paths or filenames. The boundary identifies eligible source classes,\\nexports and tool outputs, material provenance, intended use, later acquisitions\\nand the effect of prior exposure. An allowed file location or a fresh summary\\ndoes not sanitize prohibited information.\\n\\nA target owner may authorize an export, but clean-room eligibility additionally\\nrequires that the engagement's information policy admits that export and its\\nprovenance. The actual delivered/acquired material must be recorded to the extent\\nrequired by the claim. An uncertain or prohibited exposure follows the declared\\nhold/re-entry rule; it cannot be repaired by deleting its receipt or relabeling\\nthe same actor fresh. Prior actor knowledge and external acquisition channels are\\npart of the declared limits.\\n\\nAdequacy retains the distinctions required for the task's decisions and\\ncontinuations, including unresolved obligations, result standing, currentness and\\nauthority. If the permitted material is insufficient, acquire an authorized\\nextension, narrow the task with the owner, use a suitable actor or return the\\nunresolved outcome. Permission is not evidence of sufficiency, and a budget is\\nnot permission to omit a deciding condition. This applies [FOUNDATIONS Observation sufficiency](FOUNDATIONS.md#assurance-relations)\\nand its scoped preservation law; it supplies no general optimal context selector (P1, P2, P6).\",\"section\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-05--context-construction-and-clean-room-conditions\",\"start_line\":939}],\"statement\":\"Permission alone cannot establish semantic sufficiency or exclude unknown prior/external exposure.\"}}","scope":"[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"]"},{"basis":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis","context":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:context:source-first-proposal","family":"residuals","identity":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:a62977ad70d316938830d82d18f33f6d","key":30,"owner":"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:actor:f-p-author","payload":"{\"basis\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:basis\",\"consequence\":\"Hold dependent assurance or widen assessment wi